    "created_at": "2020-12-04T18:02:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-12-04T18:02:54Z",
    "body": "Huh, wild. Thanks for all the digging you've done on this!\r\n\r\nOne last thing: could you verify that running `export SHLVL` when you're in a non-login shell doesn't fix this issue? I believe that's what you noted on the linked PR, but we seem to have learned a lot since then, so let's just make sure that's still the case.\r\n\r\nIf so, then we'll chalk it up to one of the quirks of older bash shells.",
